# The player fights the Frost Warden up to its second phase, the way an agent would:
# attack, watch the journal, step until something happens.
#
# The player is made tough first (1000 hp): this checks the rules of the fight, not the
# player's luck in a fight nobody dodges. The invariant keeps the player standing.
#
# Written for the CURRENT sandbox (e5 player, e6 boss, e7 and e8 skeletons); it is
# rewritten when the sandbox moves onto the combat and motion modules.

seed 42

# --- the arena as the game spawns it, whatever was played in it before
act heal id=e5
act heal id=e6
act set id=e5 component=Health value='{"current":1000,"max":1000}'
act set id=e5 component=Stamina path=current value=80
act set id=e6 component=Boss path=phase value=1
act stop
act teleport id=e5 x=0 z=12
act teleport id=e6 x=0 z=-6
act teleport id=e7 x=-19 z=-19     # the skeletons wait in the far corners
act teleport id=e8 x=19 z=-19
invariant field e5 Health.current > 0

# --- 1. phase 1: the player walks up to the boss
expect shows e6 "phase 1"
expect field e6 Boss.phase == 1
act move_to target=e6 within=3
expect result contains "move_to e6"
step 900 --until near:e5:e6:3
expect stopped "within"

# --- 2. the first sword hit lands
act attack target=e6 repeat=true
expect result contains "attacking e6 until it dies"
step 600 --until "journal:e5 -> e6 Sword"
expect stopped "e5 -> e6 Sword"
expect journal "e5 -> e6 Sword -25"
expect field e6 Health.current < 4000

# --- 3. at half health the boss changes phase, however the health got there
mark
act set id=e6 component=Health path=current value=2010
step 900 --until named:boss_phase_2
expect stopped "boss_phase_2"
expect journal "e6 phase 1->2"
expect shows e6 "phase 2"
expect field e6 Boss.phase == 2
expect field e6 Health.current <= 2000

# --- 4. phase 2 goes on; the boss is still fighting and the player is still up
step 120
expect !journal "e5 died"
observe
expect result contains "e5 Player"
expect result contains "phase 2"
